# Suspension {#suspension}

Provider may suspend if:

- payment is overdue by more than thirty days {#suspension-overdue}
- the Client breaches confidentiality {#suspension-breach}
  - and the breach is material {#suspension-material}

This paragraph carries its own anchor. {#suspension-note}

# Consequences {#consequences}

Suspension under Section {{ref: suspension-overdue}} does not waive payment.
Section {{ref: suspension-material}} governs material breach, and Section
{{ref: suspension-note}} is a numbered paragraph reference.
